{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","title":"Psychological Layer: Trauma and Templates","description":"Bagaimana pengalaman masa lalu membentuk template reaksi di masa kini.","tags":["psychology","trauma","coping"],"custom":{"description":"Bagaimana pengalaman masa lalu membentuk template reaksi di masa kini."},"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"3443ceba4e968061b31cf1909a195c15","updated":1782198659051,"created":1782198659051,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.trauma","alias":"trauma","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.trauma"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.coping","alias":"coping","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.coping"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":11,"offset":1098},"end":{"line":19,"column":76,"offset":1163},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-psychological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":78,"offset":1165},"end":{"line":19,"column":126,"offset":1213},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting"}}],"anchors":{"psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates":{"type":"header","text":"Psychological Layer: Trauma and Templates","value":"psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"trauma-as-a-reaction-template":{"type":"header","text":"Trauma as a Reaction Template","value":"trauma-as-a-reaction-template","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"post-traumatic-growth":{"type":"header","text":"Post-Traumatic Growth","value":"post-traumatic-growth","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates\">Psychological Layer: Trauma and Templates<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates-1\">Psychological Layer: Trauma and Templates<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#psychological-layer-trauma-and-templates-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"trauma-as-a-reaction-template\">Trauma as a Reaction Template<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#trauma-as-a-reaction-template\"></a></h2>\n<p>Trauma bukan sekadar \"kejadian buruk\", melainkan pengalaman yang membentuk <strong>template reaksi</strong> otomatis di otak. Ketika trigger muncul di masa kini, otak menggunakan template lama untuk merespons.</p>\n<p><strong>Contoh Template Reaksi:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pengalaman</strong>: Kebutuhan tidak dipedulikan <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>Template</strong>: \"Kebutuhan orang lain bukan urusan gue.\"</li>\n<li><strong>Pengalaman</strong>: Peduli berujung dimanfaatkan <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>Template</strong>: \"Peduli = Jebakan.\"</li>\n<li><strong>Pengalaman</strong>: Tampil berujung dipermalukan <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>Template</strong>: \"Forum = Tempat diri gue dihancurkan.\"</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"post-traumatic-growth\">Post-Traumatic Growth<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#post-traumatic-growth\"></a></h2>\n<p>Proses penyembuhan psikologis bukan sekadar memahami luka, tetapi mengubah cara otak merespons luka tersebut.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Coping Mechanism</strong>: Belajar meregulasi emosi dan membedakan hal yang <em>controllable</em> vs <em>uncontrollable</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Resilience</strong>: Membangun kemampuan untuk bangkit dan belajar dari trauma (<em>post-traumatic growth</em>).</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Psikologis bukan cuma memahami luka; psikologis adalah mengubah cara otak merespons luka.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework\">Biopsychosocial-Cultural-Spiritual Framework</a>, <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting\">Trauma-Informed Learning and Reparenting</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">trauma (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">coping (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVau